    {
      "id": "l1",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "The wife has a dream. In the morning she wakes up and tells her husband about it.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "zhena",
      "text": "Honey, I dreamt you gave me earrings and a necklace for my birthday. What could that mean?",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.4
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "Well, just wait for your birthday in a few days.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.4
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "A few days later, full of excitement, the wife unwraps her present. She gets a book called:",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "zhena",
      "text": "Dream Interpretation for Beginners.",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
